{"timestamp": "2025-09-29T22:58:33.141352", "function_name": "make_arrow", "function_body": "  actions = []\n  \n  # Fetch goal index and corresponding primitives\n  goal_index = env.world.cookbook.index['arrow']\n  primitives_dict = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(goal_index)\n  \n  # Collecting primitives\n  for item, count in primitives_dict.items():\n      if not env._current_state.next_to(item):\n          actions.extend(env.collect_primitive_actions(item))\n      else:\n          actions.append(env.USE) * count\n  \n  # Crafting arrow at the required workshop\n  workshop_index = next(workshop for workshop, recipe in env.world.cookbook.recipes.items() if goal_index in recipe['_at'])\n  \n  if not env._current_state.next_to(workshop_index):\n      actions.extend(env.navigate_to_workshop_actions(workshop_index))\n      \n  # Perform USE action as many times as needed to craft the arrow\n  actions.append(env.USE) * primitives_dict[goal_index]\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
